{"parse": {"title": "再会在新世界-01", "pageid": 142057, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A5%A0%E5%9F%BA%E7%9F%B3%C2%B7%E5%86%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C\" title=\"奠基石·再会在新世界\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">再会在新世界-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C-02\" title=\"再会在新世界-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">再会在新世界</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E7.99.BE.E4.B8.87.E4.BA.BF.E5.BC.A0.E5.9B.BE.E7.A8.BF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一百万亿张图稿\">一百万亿张图稿</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一百万亿张图稿</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Hundred Thousand Billion Sketches</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>讲师将一大摞手稿抱摔在讲台上，做了个十分夸张的擦汗动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>首先，我很高兴在最后一节“现代城市规划”课上还能看见这么多热情的学生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我想你们大概都已经等不及要享受这周结束后的暑假了，所以我长话短说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>作为特邀讲师的这个学期，我过得很开心，可惜这大概就是我们最后一次在这个教室见面了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>台下的青少年们发出一阵阵代表不舍的怪叫声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哦，别这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>等你们学成毕业后，假如有人愿意加入我们的事务所，我想咱们还是有继续共事的机会的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那么第二个坏消息是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>鲍勃，杜法赦，米歇尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你们的期末作业不及格，恐怕你们的假期会来得稍微迟一些。但别担心，你们仍然有一次补考的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>首先是鲍勃，我很庆幸你没有负责洛杉矶的城市规划，不然那里的市中心已经被连环车祸塞满了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>台下冒出一个怯懦的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-512320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-512320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-512320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鲍勃：</div><div>女士……我只是觉得，在未来的洛杉矶，每个美国公民都能有一辆自己的汽车……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>所以你去掉了所有的步行道与自行车道？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>以洛杉矶全体公民的名义——我宣布你不及格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-512320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-512320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-512320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鲍勃：</div><div>哦不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被点名的学生瘫软地坐了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>然后是杜法赦……想象力很不错，大量贴满了锡箔的浮岛和由玻璃球罩构成的居民楼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>可惜作业的主题是城市规划，而不是给科幻小说画插图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>女士，我听说人们在月球上发掘到了一种奇妙的物质，能让玻璃变得比混凝土还结实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>也许在不远的未来，可能2062年？我们的城市就会变成这样了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好吧……你说的有道理，那等到2062年，我会拄着拐杖亲自来给你批个A+。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>至于现在，不行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>哦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>最后是米歇尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的讲师将手中的稿纸一份份地分发给学生，附上一份褒奖或叮嘱，直到最后一位学生驻留在讲台前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哦，是你……杜法赦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>很遗憾，负责你们补考事务的老师不会是我了，你得去办公室问问那群老头什么时候开放申请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>不，老师……我只是很好奇，您觉得未来的建筑会是什么样子的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>习惯于在奇思妙想间流连的建筑师扶了扶镜片，思考了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>或许在你们眼里，我是建筑与城市规划方面的专家，有过几个自己独立设计的项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但是城市是由人构成的单元，它的生长路线也少不了人们自发的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>或许就像你说的，未来会冒出一种全新的材料……而人们也选择了这种看上去有些轻佻的设计风格。那人们从诧异到接纳也不过是三十年的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>当然了，也有可能再过三十年，人们还是会觉得粗野主义的设计非常时髦。谁说得准呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>谢谢您，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>顺带一提——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div><span style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:138%\"><b>您完成您的纪念碑设计稿了吗？</b></span></span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的学生和室内风景像滴入清水的牛奶一样溶解散开，一只大手将建筑师抛向冷硬的地面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>嘿！你不能因为你挂了科就这么报复我——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>痛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>睡在沙发上总有一天会滚下来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>以及学生时代的我一次科都没挂过，我不知道你在和谁说梦话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师捶了捶劳损的后背，眼前是前段时间刚共事过的同僚，而身边的环境也不是大学的教室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650219.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-650219.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650219.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650219.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-650219.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650219.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-650219.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650219.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>稿纸，稿纸，复写纸，可以拿去砌墙的咖啡豆，被你在睡梦中压断的尺子……你是把这些废稿当被子盖了吗？我记得你以前对住所的要求没这么低的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>其实也能起到保暖的效果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对糟乱环境感到过敏的同僚将奠基石的“被子”收了起来，开始一张张翻阅着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>“用丝线和珠串表现‘暴雨’的方案”“以卧碑群为基础设计的墓园”“一把避雨的伞”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>坦白来讲，我认为这些纪念碑的方案都不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但没有一张能令我满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我希望你还记得，是基金会委托你设计“‘暴雨’灾害纪念碑”去纪念那些在第一次“暴雨”中逝去和为越过第一次“暴雨”作出巨大贡献的人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你的首要工作是令基金会满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>算了……只要成稿效果足够好，花费多少精力是你个人的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>那么，成稿呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>嗯哼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你还记得交付期限是哪天来着吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>后天？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>昨天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你不是小孩子了，你是来工作的，你和基金会正式签了合同的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>上游环节的推迟会为下游展开落地工作的人们带来很大的麻烦，我想你总不至于不明白这点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我不想这么轻佻地对待这个选题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……你还记得我们之前修复过的穹顶吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我还没老年痴呆，那只是几个月前的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石捡起一个纸团，它是一版被亲手否定的设计，如今在建筑师的手中重新被摊开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一个只对当事人有意义的穹顶复制品，因为太过私人而缺乏艺术性与专业性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>能看得出设计者刻意想要避开这轮记忆里的穹顶，但剔除掉这份记忆的设计却又缺乏灵气和情感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>在“暴雨”中逝去的人，对越过“暴雨”作出卓越贡献的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我总是会想到我的亲人和那轮穹顶上去。但他们并不是这场“暴雨”的全部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我的视角里一定还缺少了些什么，才会只能做出这些浮于表面的、偏狭的设计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>所以你是说，你打算待在你的房间里一直冥想，直到灵感忍受不了寂寞自己来敲门吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我本来以为我坐了四个小时的飞机是来验收成果的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的建筑师露出万分抱歉的表情。监工有些难以忍受地别过头去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>唉……总之，我会回基金会调度工期，再争取一个月左右的时间。这是你最后的机会了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>真的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那代价呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你还真聪明……代价就是我需要现在立刻回基金会和项目负责人沟通，先用不需要设计图的前期工作填满这一个月的工期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>但，我原本要去巴塞罗那帮当地的基金会办事处处理些“小麻烦”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我来搞定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>太棒了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>监工面无表情地说出了本应代表激动的单词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>顺带一提，前往巴塞罗那的飞机还有一个小时就起飞了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你现在拿上我的机票和证件就跑还来得及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>非要是飞机吗？我真的还挺害怕——算了！总之我欠你一次！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师抄起自己的外套，胡乱把一些铅笔和图纸塞进口袋里。一把夺过监工手中的票证，飞也似地夺门而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……唉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>监工漫步在空无一人的杂乱房间里，隐隐还能听到本应关紧的水龙头正在盥洗室欢快地唱着泄洪的歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她随手掂起一张废稿，叠放在手边那堆小山一样高的其他废稿上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>等等。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>监工终于注意到了厚度的不同凡响之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……她这几天有睡过觉吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "再会在新世界-01"}}